# IWR6843AOP mmWave Radar

The **IWR6843AOP** is a 60 GHz mmWave radar sensor used in the Smart Firefighter Safety Vest for detecting and tracking people in the surrounding environment.

## Role in the Project

The radar provides:

- Human detection
- Number of humans detected
- Distance to detected humans
- Nearest human distance
- Real-time object tracking
- Detection in low-visibility environments

This is especially useful for firefighters because the radar can detect people even when visibility is affected by smoke or darkness.

## Radar Used

| Parameter | Details |
|---|---|
| Radar | IWR6843AOP |
| Technology | 60 GHz mmWave Radar |
| Frequency | 60–64 GHz |
| Application | Human/Object Detection |
| Interface | UART |
| Detection | Range, angle and velocity |
| Processing | On-board radar processing |

